The '''2026–27 [[Moldovan Liga 1]]''' is the 36th season of Moldovan football's second-tier league. The season started on 31 July 2026 and will conclude on 15 May 2027, not including play-off matches.<ref>{{cite news|url=https://divizia-a.md/ro/news/opredelilsja-kalendar-matchejj-v-lige-1-2026-27|title=A fost stabilit programul meciurilor din Liga 1|website=divizia-a.md|publisher=|language=ro|access-date=10 July 2026|date=2 July 2026}}</ref>

